<title>ALBANIA: SOCCER-ALBANIAN FIRST DIVISION STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ALBANIAN FIRST DIVISION STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>TIRANA 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Current standings in the Albanian</p>
<p>first division which is due to resume on August 2.</p>
<p>The competition was suspended in February because of civil</p>
<p>unrest and no matches have been played since December 29. The</p>
<p>five remaining fixtures are due to be completed by August 16.</p>
<p>		   P	W    D     L    F     A   Pts</p>
<p> Flamurtari    17    12    1     4    34   15    37</p>
<p> Tirana	  17    10    4     3    34    8    34</p>
<p> Vllaznia	17    11    0     6    24   16    33</p>
<p> Apollonia     17     9    4     4    22   15    31</p>
<p> Partizani     17     9    4     4    19    5    31</p>
<p> Shkumbini     17     8    2     7    17   17    26</p>
